{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Arcade Puzzler with a twist. Instead of matching falling tokens of the same color, clear tokens by matching them up into a complete rainbow line.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAGES MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through stages on a map and defeat alien creatures by making rainbow lines. Can you save the world?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how long you can last and go for a new high score. Unlock additional endless modes by beating bosses in stages mode.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERSUS MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two player versus with one keyboard or two controllers. Who can last the longest? Make rainbow lines to trigger attacks on the opponent and speed up their token fall speed.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445300?t=1742589920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742589920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445300/eff7f86f76b430ed9cfcabb836c862a5833f7d88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742589920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445300/eff7f86f76b430ed9cfcabb836c862a5833f7d88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742589920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3571